<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan tenders to sell diesel for Jan 26-Feb 15.</title>
<headline>Taiwan tenders to sell diesel for Jan 26-Feb 15.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-owned Chinese Petroleum Corp (CPC) has issued a tender to sell 225,000-250,000 barrels of 0.3 percent sulphur diesel lifting January 26-February 15 from Kaoshiung, industry sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on January 13 and bids will valid until January 15.</p>
<p>In its last tender, CPC sold three 225,000-250,000-barrel cargoes for December 11-30 lifting at $29.92 per barrel, free-on-board Kaoshiung.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3093)</p>
</text>
